hearken-genny is a Rust port of the formant speech synthesizer in genny
(genny/speech.py) by Oriol Gómez (https://github.com/ogomez92/genny).

Copyright (c) Oriol Gómez. All rights reserved.

The port is included in Hearken, and in games built with Hearken, with the
author's permission. It is not covered by Hearken's MIT or Apache-2.0
licence. Ask the genny author before using this code anywhere else.

The British accent rules (src/accent.rs) and the British vowels in
src/phonemes.rs were added for Hearken by Joshua Tubbs (Orinks).

data/cmudict.txt.gz is the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary as genny bundles it,
Copyright (C) 1993-2015 Carnegie Mellon University. It is distributed under
its own licence, reproduced in data/CMUDICT_LICENSE, which must accompany
any copy of the dictionary in source or binary form.
